# Testing & Utilities

## Testing Framework
- Jest for unit and integration tests
- React Testing Library for component tests
- Tests located in [src/test](mdc:src/test) and component folders

## Utility Functions
- [src/utils](mdc:src/utils): General utility functions
- Helper functions for formatting, validation, and data transformation
- Custom hooks for common patterns

## Development Tools
- ESLint for code linting
- Prettier for code formatting
- TypeScript for type checking
- Jest for testing

## Accessibility
- Components follow WCAG guidelines
- Focus management utilities
- Screen reader support
- Keyboard navigation